{"task_id": "HumanEval/57", "solution": "def monotonic(l: list):\n    \"\"\"Return True if list elements are monotonically increasing or decreasing.\n    An empty or single-element list is also considered monotonic.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(l) <= 1:\n        return True\n\n    first_diff_idx = 0\n    while first_diff_idx < len(l) - 1 and l[first_diff_idx] == l[first_diff_idx + 1]:\n        first_diff_idx += 1\n\n    if first_diff_idx == len(l) - 1: # All elements are equal\n        return True\n\n    is_increasing_trend = (l[first_diff_idx] < l[first_diff_idx + 1])\n\n    for i in range(first_diff_idx, len(l) - 1):\n        if is_increasing_trend:\n            if l[i] > l[i+1]:\n                return False\n        else: # is_decreasing_trend\n            if l[i] < l[i+1]:\n                return False\n    \n    return True"}
