{"task_id": "HumanEval/89", "solution": "```python\ndef encrypt(s):\n    \"\"\"Encrypts a string using a rotational cipher, shifting alphabetic characters by 4 positions.\"\"\"\n    SHIFT_AMOUNT = 4\n    LOWER_A_ORD = ord('a')\n    UPPER_A_ORD = ord('A')\n    ALPHABET_SIZE = 26\n\n    def _is_lower(char):\n        \"\"\"Checks if a character is a lowercase English letter.\"\"\"\n        return 'a' <= char <= 'z'\n\n    def _is_upper(char):\n        \"\"\"Checks if a character is an uppercase English letter.\"\"\"\n        return 'A' <= char <= 'Z'\n\n    def _shift_char(char, base):\n        \"\"\"Shifts an alphabetic character by SHIFT_AMOUNT, wrapping around.\"\"\"\n        offset = ord(char) - base\n        shifted_offset = (offset + SHIFT_AMOUNT) % ALPHABET_SIZE\n        return chr(base + shifted_offset)\n\n    encrypted_chars = []\n    for char in s:\n        if _is_lower(char):\n            encrypted_chars.append(_shift_char(char, LOWER_A_ORD))\n        elif _is_upper(char):\n            encrypted_chars.append(_shift_char(char, UPPER_A_ORD))\n        else:\n            encrypted_chars.append(char)\n    return \"\".join(encrypted_chars)\n```"}
