{"task_id": "HumanEval/101", "solution": "```python\nclass StringSplitter:\n    \"\"\"\n    A utility class for splitting strings into words.\n    Uses commas and spaces as delimiters.\n    \"\"\"\n    def split_words(self, s):\n        \"\"\"\n        Splits the input string into a list of words.\n        Handles multiple consecutive delimiters and strips whitespace from each word.\n        \"\"\"\n        temp_s = s.replace(',', ' ')\n        words = [word.strip() for word in temp_s.split(' ') if word.strip()]\n        return words\n\ndef words_string(s):\n    \"\"\"\n    Splits a string into words, using commas or spaces as delimiters.\n    Returns a list of stripped words.\n    \"\"\"\n    splitter = StringSplitter()\n    return splitter.split_words(s)\n```"}
